=== Requirement Clarification Questions ===
1. Is it a requirement that, in every valid system instance (within the specified scope), there must always exist a state in Emergency mode with at least one pending request at each of High, Medium, and Low classification levels, or is it sufficient for this scenario to be possible only in special runs with explicit coverage assumptions?
