1. Should the assertion assertEmergencyBypassFIFOReachable and the predicate EmergencyBypassFIFOScenario only be checked in runs with explicit enabling assumptions (i.e., at least one pending request at each classification and sufficient eligible processors), and be excluded from universal verification runs?
